        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ ũtalo wa ana ma Isilaeli ũkeethĩwa ta kĩthangathĩ kya ũkanga, kĩla kĩtathimĩka kana kũtalĩka; na kũkeethĩwa vala meeiwe, Mũti andũ makwa, makeewa, Mwĩ ana ma Ngai ũla wĩ thayũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.1.10"
            ]
          }
